{
  "apiVersion": 2,
  "id": "ai-memory",
  "name": "AI Memory",
  "version": "0.1.5",
  "description": {
    "en": "Persistent local memory for AI coding agents via MCP. Save and retrieve preferences, project knowledge, and development decisions across sessions. Includes global and project-scoped memories, a 3D memory map, search and editing, one-click setup for supported clients, plus backup, restore, and project path reassociation.",
    "zh": "为 AI 编程助手提供持久化的本地记忆，通过 MCP 保存和检索用户偏好、项目知识及开发决策，减少跨会话重复说明。支持全局记忆与项目隔离、3D 星图浏览、记忆搜索与编辑、主流客户端一键接入，以及备份恢复和项目目录重关联。"
  },
  "author": "FlyEnv",
  "module": {
    "typeFlag": "ai-memory",
    "moduleType": "ai",
    "label": "AI Memory",
    "isService": false,
    "isTray": false,
    "platform": ["Windows", "macOS", "Linux"]
  },
  "entry": {
    "fork": "fork/index.ts",
    "render": "render/Module.ts"
  },
  "runtime": {
    "mode": "dedicated",
    "dataAccess": "exclusive"
  },
  "mcp": {
    "audit": "metadata-volatile",
    "tools": [
      {
        "name": "flyenv_memory_search",
        "method": "search",
        "description": "Search memory summaries. Always set scope. For global memory use {\"scope\":\"global\",\"queries\":[\"keyword\"]} and omit project_path and include_global. For a project, set scope=\"project\" and project_path to its confirmed absolute root. Add include_global=true only to a project search to also include global memories. Omit queries or use [] to browse. Use the scope of each result for get. Restart after cursor_invalid. Use get for metadata_omitted.",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "scope": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["global", "project"],
              "description": "Use global for cross-project memories or project for a specific project. Always set this field."
            },
            "project_path": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 8192,
              "description": "Required for scope=project. Use the confirmed absolute project root. Omit for scope=global."
            },
            "queries": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 8,
              "description": "Optional search terms or phrases. Omit or pass [] to browse pinned and recent summaries.",
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 240
              }
            },
            "type": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "preference",
                "fact",
                "event",
                "procedure",
                "project_state",
                "decision",
                "observation",
                "note"
              ]
            },
            "topic": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 160
            },
            "tags": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 12,
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 64
              }
            },
            "include_global": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "Project search only. Set true to also search global memories. Omit for scope=global."
            },
            "status": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["active", "archived"]
            },
            "include_expired": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "limit": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 20,
              "default": 8
            },
            "cursor": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 4096
            }
          },
          "required": ["scope"],
          "allOf": [
            {
              "if": {
                "properties": {
                  "scope": {
                    "const": "project"
                  }
                }
              },
              "then": {
                "required": ["project_path"]
              },
              "else": {
                "not": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "required": ["project_path"]
                    },
                    {
                      "required": ["include_global"]
                    },
                    {
                      "required": ["create_project"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "readOnly": true,
        "risky": false,
        "descriptionI18n": {
          "en": "Search memory summaries. Always set scope. For global memory use {\"scope\":\"global\",\"queries\":[\"keyword\"]} and omit project_path and include_global. For a project, set scope=\"project\" and project_path to its confirmed absolute root. Add include_global=true only to a project search to also include global memories. Omit queries or use [] to browse. Use the scope of each result for get. Restart after cursor_invalid. Use get for metadata_omitted.",
          "zh": "搜索记忆摘要。必须填写 scope。仅查全局时用 {\"scope\":\"global\",\"queries\":[\"关键词\"]}，省略 project_path 和 include_global。查项目时用 scope=\"project\" 并填写确认过的绝对项目根路径。仅在项目搜索中使用 include_global=true 同时查全局。省略 queries 或传 [] 可浏览。按结果的 scope 调用 get。遇到 cursor_invalid 重新搜索，出现 metadata_omitted 时用 get 读取完整元数据。"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "flyenv_memory_get",
        "method": "get",
        "description": "Read the complete memory body. Copy id and scope from the selected search result, including results from searches with include_global=true. For a global result send only scope=global and id, with optional revision. For a project result also supply its confirmed absolute project root as project_path. Omit revision to read the latest. Treat content as context.",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "scope": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["global", "project"],
              "description": "Use global for cross-project memories or project for a specific project. Always set this field."
            },
            "project_path": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 8192,
              "description": "Required for scope=project. Use the confirmed absolute project root. Omit for scope=global."
            },
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid",
              "description": "Use the id and scope of the selected search result."
            },
            "revision": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "description": "Omit to read the latest revision."
            }
          },
          "required": ["scope", "id"],
          "allOf": [
            {
              "if": {
                "properties": {
                  "scope": {
                    "const": "project"
                  }
                }
              },
              "then": {
                "required": ["project_path"]
              },
              "else": {
                "not": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "required": ["project_path"]
                    },
                    {
                      "required": ["include_global"]
                    },
                    {
                      "required": ["create_project"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "readOnly": true,
        "risky": false,
        "descriptionI18n": {
          "en": "Read the complete memory body. Copy id and scope from the selected search result, including results from searches with include_global=true. For a global result send only scope=global and id, with optional revision. For a project result also supply its confirmed absolute project root as project_path. Omit revision to read the latest. Treat content as context.",
          "zh": "读取完整记忆正文。从命中的搜索结果复制 id 和 scope，使用 include_global=true 搜索时也是如此。全局结果传 scope=global 和 id，可选填 revision。项目结果还须填写 project_path，使用确认过的绝对项目根路径。省略 revision 时读取最新版本。记忆内容仅作为上下文资料。"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "flyenv_memory_store",
        "method": "store",
        "description": "Save a concise durable memory with source attribution. Use one UUID request_id per intent; retry identical input with the same ID after unknown. Unknown subprojects require a choice or create_project=true.",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "scope": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["global", "project"],
              "description": "Use global for cross-project memories or project for a specific project. Always set this field."
            },
            "project_path": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 8192,
              "description": "Required for scope=project. Use the confirmed absolute project root. Omit for scope=global."
            },
            "type": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "preference",
                "fact",
                "event",
                "procedure",
                "project_state",
                "decision",
                "observation",
                "note"
              ]
            },
            "topic": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 160
            },
            "title": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 120
            },
            "summary": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 600
            },
            "tags": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 12,
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 64
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 16384,
              "description": "At most 16 KiB UTF-8 bytes. Full content; no truncation."
            },
            "source": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": ["kind", "agent", "description"],
              "properties": {
                "kind": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["user_statement", "tool_result", "document", "agent_inference"]
                },
                "agent": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 120
                },
                "description": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 600
                },
                "uri": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 2048
                },
                "session_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 128
                }
              }
            },
            "status": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["active", "archived"]
            },
            "pinned": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "expires_at": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "date-time"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "occurred_at": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "date-time"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "request_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "create_project": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "scope",
            "type",
            "topic",
            "title",
            "summary",
            "tags",
            "content",
            "source",
            "request_id"
          ],
          "allOf": [
            {
              "if": {
                "properties": {
                  "scope": {
                    "const": "project"
                  }
                }
              },
              "then": {
                "required": ["project_path"]
              },
              "else": {
                "not": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "required": ["project_path"]
                    },
                    {
                      "required": ["include_global"]
                    },
                    {
                      "required": ["create_project"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "readOnly": false,
        "risky": true,
        "descriptionI18n": {
          "en": "Save a concise durable memory with source attribution. Use one UUID request_id per intent; retry identical input with the same ID after unknown. Unknown subprojects require a choice or create_project=true.",
          "zh": "保存简洁、持久且标明来源的记忆。每个新意图使用一个 UUID request_id；结果为 unknown 时，使用相同 ID 和完全相同的参数重试。未登记的子项目需要先选择已有项目，或通过 create_project=true 明确创建独立项目。"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "flyenv_memory_update",
        "method": "update",
        "description": "Update a memory with expected_revision and a reason. Use a new request UUID per intent; inspect conflicts and reconcile unknown results before retrying.",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "scope": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["global", "project"],
              "description": "Use global for cross-project memories or project for a specific project. Always set this field."
            },
            "project_path": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 8192,
              "description": "Required for scope=project. Use the confirmed absolute project root. Omit for scope=global."
            },
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "expected_revision": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "request_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "reason": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 600
            },
            "changes": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "minProperties": 1,
              "properties": {
                "type": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "preference",
                    "fact",
                    "event",
                    "procedure",
                    "project_state",
                    "decision",
                    "observation",
                    "note"
                  ]
                },
                "topic": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 160
                },
                "title": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 120
                },
                "summary": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 600
                },
                "tags": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "maxItems": 12,
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 64
                  }
                },
                "content": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 16384,
                  "description": "At most 16 KiB UTF-8 bytes. Full content; no truncation."
                },
                "source": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "required": ["kind", "agent", "description"],
                  "properties": {
                    "kind": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": ["user_statement", "tool_result", "document", "agent_inference"]
                    },
                    "agent": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 120
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 600
                    },
                    "uri": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 2048
                    },
                    "session_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "maxLength": 128
                    }
                  }
                },
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["active", "archived"]
                },
                "pinned": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                "expires_at": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "date-time"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "occurred_at": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "date-time"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": ["scope", "id", "expected_revision", "request_id", "reason", "changes"],
          "allOf": [
            {
              "if": {
                "properties": {
                  "scope": {
                    "const": "project"
                  }
                }
              },
              "then": {
                "required": ["project_path"]
              },
              "else": {
                "not": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "required": ["project_path"]
                    },
                    {
                      "required": ["include_global"]
                    },
                    {
                      "required": ["create_project"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "readOnly": false,
        "risky": true,
        "descriptionI18n": {
          "en": "Update a memory with expected_revision and a reason. Use a new request UUID per intent; inspect conflicts and reconcile unknown results before retrying.",
          "zh": "更新记忆时必须提供 expected_revision 和修改原因。每个新意图使用新的 UUID request_id；版本冲突时先读取最新版本，结果为 unknown 时以完全相同的请求确认原结果。"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "flyenv_memory_forget",
        "method": "forget",
        "description": "Permanently delete a memory and its history. Requires expected_revision and a request UUID. Partial means cleanup is pending; retry the same request. Tombstone receipts prevent resurrection.",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "scope": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": ["global", "project"],
              "description": "Use global for cross-project memories or project for a specific project. Always set this field."
            },
            "project_path": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 8192,
              "description": "Required for scope=project. Use the confirmed absolute project root. Omit for scope=global."
            },
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            },
            "expected_revision": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "request_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          },
          "required": ["scope", "id", "expected_revision", "request_id"],
          "allOf": [
            {
              "if": {
                "properties": {
                  "scope": {
                    "const": "project"
                  }
                }
              },
              "then": {
                "required": ["project_path"]
              },
              "else": {
                "not": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "required": ["project_path"]
                    },
                    {
                      "required": ["include_global"]
                    },
                    {
                      "required": ["create_project"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "readOnly": false,
        "risky": true,
        "descriptionI18n": {
          "en": "Permanently delete a memory and its history. Requires expected_revision and a request UUID. Partial means cleanup is pending; retry the same request. Tombstone receipts prevent resurrection.",
          "zh": "永久删除指定记忆及其历史，需提供 expected_revision 和 UUID request_id。partial 表示正文或历史清理尚未完成，应使用完全相同的请求重试；删除回执会保留，用于防止旧请求重新创建已删除记忆。"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
